  "open_findings": [
    "AppActivate is not yet end-to-end equivalent: GLQuake calls S_BlockSound/S_UnblockSound and the mixer suppresses updates while blocked, but MiniQuake's gl_vidnt soundBlocked flag is not consumed by the real host/audio mixer. This must be integrated and rechecked before gl_vidnt can pass."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Automated tests enumerate and CDS_TEST display modes but deliberately do not mutate and restore the user's physical desktop mode; an interactive fullscreen set/restore pass remains required.",
    "GetDeviceGammaRamp was unavailable in the current desktop session, so palette correction is differentially covered while live hardware gamma set/restore remains an environment gate."
  ]
